                                                "text": "a vigorous search"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd7d509c-5bcb-49f5-ba7d-9aee2a64c2d9",
                                                "sense_id": "87c4171c-41e2-3718-8550-d35ebc344036",
                                                "text": "Life in the country will be fuller, richer, and more comfortful, because it is freer, healthier, and more vigorous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8b860ff9-1ffd-4061-b82a-60c22841edf5",
                                                "sense_id": "87c4171c-41e2-3718-8550-d35ebc344036",
                                                "text": "Now there are twenty-nine skaters on Wollman Rink\nCircling in singles and in pairs\nIn this vigorous anonymity"
